  "description": "Why AI gives useless answers: your prompt is too vague. Use task + context + format, then refine.\n\nA dad asks, his teen explains — with a real example of turning a vague prompt into a clear one.\n\nAInation Studio — AI, explained simply. Subscribe: https://www.youtube.com/@AI.nationstudio",
