  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Why does AI keep giving me useless answers?",
      "board": {
        "type": "title",
        "left": {
          "icon": "user",
          "label": "VAGUE"
        },
        "right": {
          "icon": "bulb",
          "label": "CLEAR"
        },
        "subtitle": "Better prompts, better answers"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Because your prompt is too vague! A prompt is just the instructions you give the AI.",
      "punch": "vague",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "chat",
        "text": "Prompt = your instructions",
        "cue": "instructions"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "So what's a bad prompt?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Like, write a poem. About what? How long? For who? The AI has to guess.",
      "board": {
        "type": "chat",
        "title": "VAGUE PROMPT",
        "color": "#FF4D6D",
        "items": [
          {
            "who": "user",
            "text": "Write a poem.",
            "cue": "write"
          },
          {
            "who": "bot",
            "text": "About what? How long?",
            "cue": "guess"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Okay, so how do I write a good one?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Use three parts. First, the task. Then, the context. Then, the format you want.",
      "board": {
        "type": "steps",
        "title": "GOOD PROMPT",
        "color": "#2ECC71",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "Task: what to do",
            "icon": "target",
            "cue": "task"
          },
          {
            "label": "Context: who, why",
            "icon": "book",
            "cue": "context"
          },
          {
            "label": "Format: length, style",
            "icon": "doc",
            "cue": "format"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Give me an example."
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Write a short, funny poem for my dad's birthday. He loves cricket. Keep it under eight lines.",
      "board": {
        "type": "compare",
        "left": {
          "label": "VAGUE",
          "color": "#FF4D6D",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Write a poem",
              "icon": "doc",
              "tick": false
            }
          ]
        },
        "right": {
          "label": "CLEAR",
          "color": "#2ECC71",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Funny birthday poem",
              "icon": "target",
              "cue": "funny",
              "tick": true
            },
            {
              "text": "He loves cricket",
              "icon": "book",
              "cue": "cricket",
              "tick": true
            },
            {
              "text": "Under 8 lines",
              "icon": "doc",
              "cue": "eight",
              "tick": true
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Wow, that's way more specific!",
      "punch": "specific"
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Can I tell it who to be, too?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Yes! Start with a role, like: you are a friendly teacher. It changes the style of the answer.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "user",
        "text": "Give it a role",
        "cue": "role",
        "sub": "\"You are a friendly teacher...\"",
        "sub_cue": "teacher"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Exactly. And if the answer isn't right, just reply and ask it to change something.",
      "board": {
        "type": "checklist",
        "title": "Then refine it",
        "icon": "chat",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Too long? Ask for shorter",
            "cue": "reply"
          },
          {
            "text": "Wrong tone? Say so",
            "cue": "change"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "So: clear task, context, and format.",
      "board": {
        "type": "summary",
        "rows": [
          {
            "text": "1. TASK",
            "icon": "target",
            "cue": "task",
            "color": "#FF4D6D"
          },
          {
            "text": "2. CONTEXT",
            "icon": "book",
            "cue": "context",
            "color": "#0A84FF"
          },
          {
            "text": "3. FORMAT",
            "icon": "doc",
            "cue": "format",
            "color": "#2ECC71"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "You got it! Follow AI Nation Studio for more. And next time AI gives you a useless answer... check your prompt!"
    }
  ],
